  "body": "## Summary\n\nLittle Say's model instructions and starter messages are embedded in business logic, making prompt changes difficult to find and review. This moves the existing text into documented top-level JSON resources with typed validation and literal substitution. Models receive the same requests, and parents see the same presets and behavior.\n\nServer prompts stay server-only; shared presets use the existing Node/Expo loading paths. Account exports are preserved. Deferred ChatGPT grants in PR20 remain outside this change.\n\nCloses #23.\n\n## Test plan and behavior evidence\n\n| Scenario | Expected and observed | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Run matching synthetic requests on actual master and the extracted resources, including Unicode, quotes, dollar signs, braces and newlines. | Complete serialized payloads and starter/preset outputs are byte-identical across affected operations, picture styles, speech languages and model selections. | [Fresh Before/After captures](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/49195f9dd70ce9a9842c460e57348c3d73935cb2/comparison.json) |\n| Load source and source-free ESM; export web, iOS and Android. | All three exports pass. Client bundles contain shared presets and exclude server-prompt markers. The relocated production server returns HTTP 200 with AI disabled; invalid resources/substitutions fail clearly. | [Runtime and bundle checks](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/49195f9dd70ce9a9842c460e57348c3d73935cb2/runtime-report.json) |\n| Create/refine starter boards and conversations with mocked providers, including cancellation and failed saves. | All 17 Chromium scenarios pass; prompts, drafts, consent and recovery remain intact. | [Browser results](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/49195f9dd70ce9a9842c460e57348c3d73935cb2/oct09-browser.log) |\n\nThis is a non-UI extraction with unchanged request behavior; exact payload comparison is its observable Before/After contract. Fresh captures compare actual master `18aa7c0` with final source `29e8fa8c`. [Source, harness and artifact identities](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/49195f9dd70ce9a9842c460e57348c3d73935cb2/manifest.json) and [applicability/retained originals](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/49195f9dd70ce9a9842c460e57348c3d73935cb2/applicability.json) are preserved outside product history.\n\n## Supporting checks and limitations\n\n`npm run check` passed: metadata, types, 320 tests, server build and web export. The merged runtime dependency supports passing iOS and Android exports. [Current-revision CI](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/actions/runs/37870046517) and revision-scoped independent QA are recorded separately. The bot [declined this revision's review solely for quota](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/pull/35#issuecomment-6072402436); no completed bot review is claimed.\n\nDocker engine execution remains unperformed; its unchanged dist-copy contract and relocated runtime were checked. Native-device testing is deferred. No signed build, live inference, release or deployment was performed.\n",
